/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2008 StTriggerData2008

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 8 (year 2008) trigger data.

\section sec2008_overview Overview

StTriggerData2008 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 8 (year 2008)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TrgDataType2008 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2008.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2007, Run 8 adds partial <b>BTOF</b> multiplicity readout via
tofAtAddress() and tofMultiplicity(), reflecting the start of BTOF installation.

\section sec2008_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2008
\endcode

\section sec2008_runyear Run Year
Run 8, calendar year 2008 &mdash; d+Au and p+p collisions at &radic;s = 200 GeV.

\section sec2008_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TrgDataType2008* | Pointer to the raw Run 8 trigger bank in memory. |

\section sec2008_new New Compared to 2007

<b>TOF (BTOF, partial installation):</b>
- tofAtAddress(int address, int prepost=0) &mdash; raw BTOF value at address.
- tofMultiplicity(int prepost=0) &mdash; BTOF hit multiplicity.

getDsm0_BEMCE(), getDsm0_BEMCW(), and getDsm1_BEMC() return \c nullptr for this format.

\section sec2008_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short tofMult = trgData->tofMultiplicity(0);
    unsigned short vpdDT   = trgData->vpdTimeDifference();
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2007
\see StTriggerData2009
*/
